			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Implement extension storage, secrets, and window messaging to Mountain\n\nAdd real implementations for extension context APIs that delegate to Mountain via gRPC:\n\n1. **Window messages**: Connect showInformationMessage, showErrorMessage, showWarningMessage to Mountain's \"window.showMessage\" endpoint\n2. **Extension storage paths**: Create and manage real storage directories under ~/.codeeditorland/extensions/storage, ~/.codeeditorland/globalStorage, and ~/.codeeditorland/logs for each extension\n3. **Secrets API**: Delegate get, store, delete operations to Mountain via secrets.get/secrets.store/secrets.delete requests\n4. **Language providers**: Add support for on-type formatting, selection ranges, semantic tokens, call hierarchy, type hierarchy, and linked editing range\n5. **Document sync**: Update notification handlers to support the new DTO format ($acceptModelAdded, $acceptModelRemoved, $acceptModelSaved) alongside legacy formats\n\nThese changes enable extensions to persist state, store secrets securely, and display native dialogs, with all backend operations coordinated through Mountain.",
			"SHA": "56e3994c94bee07d1689d5165994c8140afbe6e5"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-16T12:26:42Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				678,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Add bidirectional language provider sync with Mountain\n\nRegister all language provider events (hover, completion, definition, references, code actions, document symbols, formatting) with Mountain via SendToMountain. Also forward executeCommand to Mountain when no local handler exists.\n\nAdd document content cache that mirrors open documents from Mountain. Handles $acceptModelChanged, $acceptModelOpen, $acceptModelClose notifications to keep cached content in sync. Modify LoadContent to prefer cached content (with unsaved edits) over disk reads for accurate language server responses.\n\nThis enables Mountain to coordinate language services across the extension host boundary and ensures language providers receive real-time document content including unsaved edits.",
			"SHA": "c35fe3cc4880fdab3fd15a543e5aa240945c1262"
		},
		{
