				32
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Remove .js extensions from @codeeditorland/output import paths\n\nUpdate import statements across the Cocoon codebase to use extensionless import paths for @codeeditorland/output modules. This change removes the explicit .js extensions from static imports of VS Code types and utilities, aligning with modern TypeScript/ESM best practices.\n\nAffected modules include IPC handlers, type converters, services, and webview panel components. The Target/ directory contains the updated compiled JavaScript output.",
			"SHA": "562d25043c176c3f769fd7d136b88f781e40a22a"
